// ============================================================================
//  mod_metalstorm.zone  -  the STORM PSR, the campaign's charge-shot sniper.
//
//  User request, 2026-09-06: "add the storm psr from the campaign into my mod as
//  another weapon in the mystery box, the bo2 reimagined mod already does this so
//  just get it from their, make sure no sounds or anything are missing and make
//  sure its not missing anything else like pap camos or animated pap camos".
//
//  Internal name is "metalstorm_mms" - Treyarch's development name, the same
//  shape as the XPR-50 shipping as `as50` and the Tac-45 as `fnp45`. Do not
//  confuse it with the campaign's Metal Storm DRONE (drone_metalstorm /
//  metalstorm_gun_turret in monsoon.ff and karma_2.ff); those are a vehicle and
//  its turret, nothing to do with this gun.
//
//  WHERE EVERY PIECE COMES FROM  (measured 2026-09-06, not assumed)
//    zone_source\metalstorm_donor\mod.ff   everything below except the camo.
//        Re-linked by build_metalstorm.bat from BO2-Reimagined's shipped copy of
//        the campaign package weapons!metalstorm_mms_sp.ff. It has to come from
//        there: this machine's Black Ops II has no campaign half, and a sweep of
//        all 226 files in retail's zonell found the world model and the storm
//        materials in la_1b.ff and the HUD icon in frontend.ff and NOTHING ELSE
//        - no view model, no view anims, no tracers, no sound alias table.
//    zone_assets\camo\camo_metalstorm.json  the camo, compiled from json by OAT.
//    weapons\zm\metalstorm*_mms*_zm         the ten weapon defs, shipped RAW in
//        mod.iwd (19,941-19,980 bytes, all under the 20,480 ceiling).
//
//  🔊 THE SOUND IS ALREADY IN THE GAME AND COSTS THIS MOD NOTHING.
//  The only sound asset declared here is the ALIAS TABLE (soundbank
//  wpn_metalstormsnp.all, 60 rows). Its 35 distinct audio payloads were hashed
//  with the engine's own snd_id and looked up across all 239 installed banks:
//  35 of 35 live in cmn_root.all.sabl, which loads on EVERY map - and the user's
//  custom sound pack ships its own cmn_root.all.sabl carrying all 35 as well.
//  So NOT ONE ROW is added to mod.all: the mod cannot shadow the pack, and the
//  pack keeps winning. (CLAUDE.md's sound rules, the "no loaded bank has its
//  sound" test - it does have it, so we declare nothing.)
//
//  🎨 THE PACK-A-PUNCH CAMO IS THIS PROJECT'S WORK, NOT REIMAGINED'S.
//  Reimagined's camo_metalstorm.json ships with slot 11 ("dragon") filled and
//  EVERY OTHER SLOT EMPTY - so their Storm PSR has no zombies Pack-a-Punch camo
//  at all, and no animated one either. Identical defect to camo_titus6 (v1.94.0).
//  zone_assets\camo\camo_metalstorm.json fills, from the two base materials the
//  file's own slot 11 names:
//      slot  3  camo index 39  mtl_weapon_camo_zombies    (stock PaP / option OFF)
//      slot  8  camo index 40  mtl_weapon_camo_zmb_dlc2   (the ANIMATED camo)
//      slot 12  camo index 45  mtl_weapon_camo_3layer     (Origins' own blue)
//  All six of those materials are already in mod.ff - verified by --list.
//
//  🛑 NO camo_qol_ RETARGET IS NEEDED, and that is measured, not assumed. The 48
//  stock guns need one because the MAP owns their camo asset and beats mod.ff.
//  `camo_metalstorm` is owned by NO retail fastfile - checked against all six
//  zombies maps plus common_zm/patch_zm/common_mp/patch_mp/monsoon/ui_zm and the
//  two code_post_gfx files - so mod.ff is its only owner on every map already.
// ============================================================================

// ---- the gun itself: view model, world model, and its 24 view anims
xmodel,t6_wpn_special_storm_view_sp
xmodel,t6_wpn_special_storm_world

xanim,viewmodel_storm_ads_fire
xanim,viewmodel_storm_ads_sp_down
xanim,viewmodel_storm_ads_sp_up
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_back
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_forward
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_in
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_left
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_out
xanim,viewmodel_storm_crawl_right
xanim,viewmodel_storm_d2p_in
xanim,viewmodel_storm_d2p_loop
xanim,viewmodel_storm_d2p_out
xanim,viewmodel_storm_fire
xanim,viewmodel_storm_first_raise
xanim,viewmodel_storm_idle
xanim,viewmodel_storm_pullout
xanim,viewmodel_storm_pullout_quick
xanim,viewmodel_storm_putaway
xanim,viewmodel_storm_putaway_quick
xanim,viewmodel_storm_rechamber
xanim,viewmodel_storm_reload_empty
xanim,viewmodel_storm_sprint_in
xanim,viewmodel_storm_sprint_loop
xanim,viewmodel_storm_sprint_out

